[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Reward for Virtue]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.28]Why did Hugh's diet not work? | 为什么休的节食不管用？
[00:15.33]My friend, Hugh, has always been fat, | 我的朋友休一直很胖，
[00:19.77]but things got so bad recently that he decided to go on a diet. | 但是近来情况变得越发糟糕，以致他决定节食。
[00:26.32]He began his diet a week ago. | 他是一星期前开始节食的。
[00:29.61]First of all, he wrote out a long list of all the foods which were forbidden. | 首先，他开列了一张长长的禁食清单，
[00:36.88]The list included most of the things Hugh loves: | 这张单子上的大多数食物都是休爱吃的：
[00:41.30]butter, potatoes, rice, beer, milk, chocolate, and sweets. | 黄油、土豆、大米、啤酒、牛奶、巧克力和糖果。
[00:48.64]Yesterday I paid him a visit. | 昨天我去看望了他。
[00:51.97]I rang the bell and was not surprised to see that Hugh was still as fat as ever. | 我按响了门铃，看到休仍和往常一样胖，这并不使我感到意外。
[00:59.28]He led me into his room and hurriedly hid a large parcel under his desk. | 他把我带进房间，急忙把一个大包裹藏到桌子下面。
[01:05.80]It was obvious that he was very embarrassed. | 很显然他感到非常尴尬。
[01:10.03]When I asked him what he was doing, | 当我问他正干什么时，
[01:12.70]he smiled guiltily and then put the parcel on the desk. | 他内疚地笑了笑，然后把包裹放到了桌面上。
[01:17.78]He explained that his diet was so strict that he had to reward himself occasionally. | 他解释说，他的节食是如此严格，以致他不得不偶尔犒劳犒劳自己。
[01:25.59]Then he showed me the contents of the parcel. | 然后他给我看了包裹里的东西。
[01:29.35]It contained five large bars of chocolate and three bags of sweets! | 里面装着5大块巧克力和3袋糖果！
